b_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your skill is your only meta-progression!</strong> <br>\u00a0 \u2022 All cards and relics unlocked from the start. No grind!<br>\u00a0 \u2022 Archive unlocks provide strategic references, not power boosts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/147288182b3a75af00530a821061a172.poster.avif?t=1752215443\" width=560 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/147288182b3a75af00530a821061a172.webm?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689680/extras/147288182b3a75af00530a821061a172.mp4?t=1752215443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart luck system for consistent fun!</strong><br>\u00a0 \u2022 Pseudo-random algorithms prevent bad streaks<br>\u00a0 \u2022 Rewards tailored to your strategy. Keep your deck focused!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Card art uses AI-assisted design (no added cost). Future hand-drawn updates may increase price.</p>",
